<Mod id="e1d06873-8852-4801-b009-bdd06a361519" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Capture The Flag</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>Capture Enemy flag units to win</Teaser>
    <Description>Each player starts with a flag unit, when the first city is created.
Protect the unit to hinder others to win.
Bring any one enemy flag unit home to win.
TThe Victory condition is considered defeault enabled.</Description>
    <Authors>yepzer</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>whoward69</SpecialThanks>
